# Third-party material captured for verification. NOT redistributed.
# sources/ holds the full text of another author's master's thesis
# (131 pp, licensed CC BY-NC-ND) and saved captures of a commercial
# vendor's website. Redistributing them adds nothing to reproducibility,
# so this repository publishes the provenance record instead:
# provenance/sources-provenance.md gives the retrieval URL, date, method
# and integrity hash for every file, and provenance/CHECKSUMS.txt lets a
# reader confirm that a re-retrieved copy is byte-identical to ours.
sources/

# Internal development documents (series convention: not published)
